  "modules": [
    {
      "id": "uniequip_001_skfire",
      "name": {
        "en": "Skyfire's Badge",
        "zh": "天火证章",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "type": "INITIAL",
      "typeName2": "",
      "icon": "original",
      "description": {
        "en": "Operator Skyfire has demonstrated a remarkable aptitude for inflicting Arts casualties on multitudes of enemies.\nThe Field Operations Department has thus passed the following resolution:\nThis operator shall be appointed a Caster Operator during field operations to exercise Splash Caster responsibilities.\nIn witness whereof,\nThis badge is hereby conferred upon the above named.",
        "zh": "干员天火擅长对复数敌人造成法术杀伤\n根据外勤部门决议\n在外勤任务中划分为术师干员，行使扩散术师职责\n特别颁发此证章\n以兹证明",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "servers": [
        "cn",
        "global"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "uniequip_002_skfire",
      "name": {
        "en": "Fire Retardant Treatment",
        "zh": "阻燃处理方案",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "type": "ADVANCED",
      "typeName2": "Y",
      "icon": "uniequip_002_skfire",
      "description": {
        "en": "'The Infected who call themselves 'Reunion'... attacked three schools in the vicinity of the Infected slums... whoops.'\n'Burned the paper again? Rewrite it.'\nThe elderly Savra watches from across the desk as the Mountbelan heiress crumples the scorched paper and furiously tosses it into the rubbish bin.\n'The Infected who call...'\n'Five students were injured in the attack. Furthermore... No! This is pissing me off!'\n'All that these 'Reunion' scoundrels are doing is getting revenge on society and making everyone even more afraid of the Infected! Professor, there is no way I can forgive them.'\nHer professor does not answer her directly. After a brief moment of silence, he picks up the pen that was tossed toward him and sets it down next to Ethelflaed.\n'Try it again.'\n\n'Article 5 of the 'Infected Regulation Act...' The Infected's area of activity shall be limited to... This is what they came up with after all those meetings? Haven't they learned their lesson from 'Reunion'—Oh, I'm very sorry, Professor. And I managed to control myself so well.'\nEthelflaed lets go of the sheet of paper in a fluster. The meeting's document is once again scorched.\n'...It's really these documents' fault for being so foolish, though. Look at the ruckus the Infected are causing. How could those boneheaded lords still be cozying up to each other?'\n'Professor, I'll write them all a letter of complaint.'\n'They have to take the 'Reunion' problem more seriously and deal with it in the most effective manner. They must immediately—'\n'Uhh... It's burning again.'\n'Right. Try it one more time.'\n\n'Finally, exiled Infected are extraordinarily likely to bear a grudge and seek opportunities for revenge against the city... Phew, I'm done, Professor. I'm not particularly fond of this justification, but they don't leave me much choice. We have to put it in terms that those stubborn, short-sighted blockheads can understand.'\nEthelflaed wrote fifteen whole pages with the neatest handwriting and not the slightest scorch mark. She looks excitedly toward her professor.\n'Good.' Angst nods and takes out a letter he had written. It is addressed to a 'Rhodes Island', a name she is unfamiliar with.\n'You know the theory. You have mastered the techniques. Your studies can finally begin.'\n'You want to solve both the Infected's problems and the 'Reunion' problem... In that case, you should meet those who are truly fighting those problems head on.'",
        "zh": "“自称‘整合运动’的感染者……对感染者聚居区附近的三处学校进行了破坏……造成……啊。”\n“又把纸烧坏了？再抄一份吧。”\n年迈的萨弗拉平静地坐在书桌对面，看着蒙贝兰家的大小姐把烧焦的纸页揉成一团，恼怒地扔进垃圾桶。\n“自称‘整合运动’的……”\n“有五名学生在袭击中受重伤，另有……不行！气死我了！”\n“那些自称‘整合运动’的恶徒只是在报复社会，让人更害怕感染者而已！老师，我绝不能原谅他们。”\n老师并没有直接回答她。片刻沉默之后，他把扔到自己面前的笔放回艾塞尔芙蕾手边。\n“再来一次吧。”\n\n“《感染者管理条例》第五条……感染者的活动范围应限于……这就是他们开会得出的结果？‘整合运动’难道没有让他们吸取一点教训——啊，抱歉，老师。明明之前我都已经控制得很好了。”\n艾塞尔芙蕾慌张地松开手，议会的文件上出现了一道焦痕。\n“……不过，都怪这些文件的内容太愚蠢。感染者们都已经闹成那样了，一群头脑空空的贵族还在互相说场面话。”\n“老师，我现在就要开始给他们写意见书。”\n“我要他们正视‘整合运动’出现的原因，并且采取最切实有效的处理方式，立刻——”\n“……呃，又烧着了。”\n“嗯，重写吧。”\n\n“最后，被赶出城市的感染者有极大概率产生怨恨心理，继而寻找机会对城市采取报复行动……呼，老师，我写完了。虽然我讨厌这些说法，但没办法，得让那些迂腐又目光短浅的家伙看懂嘛。”\n艾塞尔芙蕾洋洋洒洒写了十五页纸，字迹工整，纸面上没有任何焦黄的痕迹。她满心期待地看着自己的老师。\n“好。”昂斯特点了点头，然后取出一封已经写好的信。信封的收件人处写着一个陌生的名字“罗德岛”。\n“你已经知晓了理论，掌握了手段，你的学习至此可以开始了。”\n“你所想要解决的，感染者的问题，‘整合运动’的问题……你该去见见真正在和这一切斗争的人了。”",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "servers": [
        "cn",
        "global"
      ],
